760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-19.03.13-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-19.03.13-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-19.03.13-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4132'>\n\t\t\t\tCorn Hole tournament after dinner\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-21.08.34.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-21.08.34.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4133\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-21.08.34.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-21.08.34-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-21.08.34-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-02-21.08.34-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4133'>\n\t\t\t\tSitting around the fire after the corn hole tournement\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-03-14.45.44.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-03-14.45.44.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4134\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-03-14.45.44.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-03-14.45.44-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-03-14.45.44-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/09\/2017-09-03-14.45.44-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4134'>\n\t\t\t\tFolks enjoying &#8220;road golf&#8221;\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Overnight rate (for 2017) is only $45 per night and Sue (616-901-4060) will be happy to get you a spot for a night and she can give you all the details about seasonal rates and ownership opportunities as well.<\/p>\n<p>I encourage you to take the opportunity to stay at PM (Pere Marquette) Oaks RV Resort. \u00a0Not only are you less than an hour away from Lake Michigan and the beautiful Ludington State Park, but you&#8217;re only minutes away from Big Star Lake where you can canoe, kayak, or jet ski and you will be just a hop, skip, and a jump from the famous <a href=\"http:\/\/www.visitpmriver.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pere Marquette River<\/a> which is one of the premier Rainbow Trout and Steelhead streams in the Midwest. \u00a0If you want something a little different, Lake County boasts 47 trout streams and 153 lakes, so there&#8217;s surely someplace right for you.<\/p>\n<p>Kathy and I will be heading back to PMO in the spring of 2018 for another workamping season and who knows, &#8230; maybe we&#8217;ll see you there!<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you smooth roads and sunny skies &#8230;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Summer&#8217;s over and our 4 month workamping gig has come to an end.\u00a0 We had a great experience at a wonderful park in a beautiful area of the country and I wanted to share a little info with you in hopes that you might have an opportunity to spend some time in this often &#8220;skipped&#8221; &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/09\/23\/rv-park-review-pere-marquette-oaks-rv-condo-resort-michigan\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">RV Park Review &#8211; Pere Marquette Oaks RV &#8220;Condo&#8221; Resort (Michigan)<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,677,554707329,30025],"tags":[554707400,554707379,554707355,554707454,554707453,14120],"class_list":["post-4103","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-friends","category-traveling","category-working","tag-lake-county","tag-party","tag-pere-marquette","tag-picnic","tag-pmo","tag-swimming"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4103","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4103"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4103\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4138,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4103\/revisions\/4138"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4103"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4103"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4103"}],"curies":[{"nam